Build a brand quote poster around a central quote. Organize the screen into a dark rounded information panel with a high-energy colored border. Place bold, blocky opening quotation marks in the top section and giant, subtle closing quotation marks in the bottom section. The quote should be in a light, geometric sans-serif font, left-aligned in 3-4 lines. Use a high-brightness accent color for the border and opening quotes, with a very deep low-brightness color for the main panel background. The style should be clean digital vector with no gradients or shadows. 
---
